WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.940
North Korea fired multiple missiles toward the sea, raising security concerns for millions across East Asia. This is Omni View, episode 220. Argentine cattle moved by boat, a Hong Kong housing resignation, El Salvador's pledge for Haiti, then understanding the issue. North Korea directed the projectiles away from land, and they did not cross into South Korean territory. The tests occurred as tensions with South Korea increased. The launches took place amid ongoing friction between the two Koreas.

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:31.140
AP news reports.

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:36.080
The action fits a pattern of military signaling that North Korean authorities have used in

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:38.180
prior periods of heightened regional strain.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:43.460
Military signaling, as those authorities have used it, means showing missiles in flight

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.820
without sending them on to another country's soil.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.240
Officials in Seoul track the flights.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.560
They issued public alerts to residents in affected areas.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:56.540
The alerts went to people living near the pads, even though the projectile stayed over water.

00:00:56.540 --> 00:01:01.560
The tests coincide with broader diplomatic efforts in the region that have yet to produce

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.140
new agreements on arms control.

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:08.980
Arms control in this setting means negotiated limits on weapons, and those talks have not

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:09.980
produced a new pact.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:15.220
Regional governments will continue monitoring for additional tests or diplomatic statements.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:19.400
Argentine farmers are moving cattle by boat to higher ground.

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:25.560
Rising water levels from El Nino have flooded grazing land, and the evacuations Al Jazeera

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:29.800
reports are a direct response to flooding that has removed usable pasture.

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:35.180
The moves protect livestock from drowning or starvation while pastures remain underwater.

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:37.980
Farmers are waiting for the waters to recede.

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:41.400
Local authorities have coordinated some of the boat transport.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:45.740
Many operations still rely on individual farmers using their own vessels.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:48.140
The flooding has also damaged roads.

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:53.040
Normal hurting routes are impassable, so boats have become the way to move animals that

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:54.000
would once have walked.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.500
Farmer's will track water levels and seek government support for feed and relocation costs.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:04.979
An independent committee in Hong Kong found that a housing checking unit failed to supervise

00:02:04.979 --> 00:02:06.859
maintenance work at the building that burned.

00:02:07.499 --> 00:02:11.819
Hong Kong's housing minister stepped down after that official report on the deadly fire.

00:02:12.359 --> 00:02:16.919
The report identified failures in the housing bureau's checking unit, the Hindu International

00:02:16.919 --> 00:02:22.159
Reports, and the committee concluded the unit had not properly supervised maintenance work.

00:02:22.159 --> 00:02:26.159
The resignation followed the release of the full investigation findings.

00:02:26.639 --> 00:02:29.979
The fire at Wang Fuke Court killed 168 people.

00:02:30.539 --> 00:02:33.539
It exposed gaps in how renovation projects were inspected.

00:02:34.119 --> 00:02:38.439
Government statements emphasized that the minister accepted responsibility for the oversight

00:02:38.439 --> 00:02:39.099
shortcomings.

00:02:39.819 --> 00:02:44.359
Authorities will implement the report's recommendations on oversight and contractor standards.

00:02:45.393 --> 00:02:49.033
El Salvador announced it will send more than 2,000 soldiers to Haiti.

00:02:49.033 --> 00:02:54.273
The deployment aims to support searches for four missing Salvadoran personnel and to

00:02:54.273 --> 00:02:55.733
assist against armed gangs.

00:02:56.173 --> 00:03:00.973
The four Salvadorans disappeared on October 18 after an ambush in Croy de bouquet.

00:03:01.693 --> 00:03:06.433
The pledge came on the same day Haiti postponed its first round presidential vote from December

00:03:06.433 --> 00:03:09.893
to July 18th, 2027, Al Jazeera reports.

00:03:10.653 --> 00:03:13.333
Haitian authorities cited security concerns for the delay.

00:03:13.333 --> 00:03:18.833
day. The postponement extends a period without elected government that has lasted since 2016.

00:03:19.713 --> 00:03:23.933
El Salvador's president has already sent initial troops. He has publicly threatened

00:03:23.933 --> 00:03:28.908
Haitian gangs if the missing personnel are not released. Shell reported quarterly

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:34.088
profit nearly double the level from a year earlier. Record refining margins and higher energy

00:03:34.088 --> 00:03:39.408
prices drove the increase, and the company also raised its share buyback program, CNBC

00:03:39.408 --> 00:03:45.648
reports. A share buyback is when a company purchases its own shares. Refining margins are the gap

00:03:45.648 --> 00:03:50.968
between what crude oil costs and what fuels made from its sell for, and those margins hit a record.

00:03:51.688 --> 00:03:56.788
Geopolitical volatility contributed to the stronger results in the refining segment. The refined

00:03:56.788 --> 00:04:02.308
products crunch pushed fuel prices higher across multiple markets. Shell's earnings reflect both

00:04:02.308 --> 00:04:07.728
upstream production, taking oil and gas out of the ground, and downstream processing gains during

00:04:07.728 --> 00:04:13.308
the quarter. Investors will watch how sustained high margins affect consumer fuel prices and company

00:04:13.308 --> 00:04:19.972
guidance. Hugh Gimber, a JP Morgan strategist, said closer economic links between the United Kingdom

00:04:19.972 --> 00:04:26.092
and the European Union or EU would support the pound and investment. The comment followed the UK

00:04:26.092 --> 00:04:30.452
budget announcement, and he made the remarks at a London event for Bloomberg subscribers.

00:04:31.052 --> 00:04:35.712
Reduced trade friction would improve long-term prospects, he said, and he linked potential

00:04:35.712 --> 00:04:39.372
regulatory alignment to stronger capital inflows over several years.

00:04:39.972 --> 00:04:44.312
The budget itself contains measures on energy costs and welfare spending that markets are

00:04:44.312 --> 00:04:45.032
still assessing.

00:04:45.992 --> 00:04:50.272
Gimber spoke before a live audience on the opening trades after the budget before the

00:04:50.272 --> 00:04:50.952
Bell program.

00:04:51.612 --> 00:04:56.012
Markets will assess any follow-up signals from both governments on regulatory alignment.

00:04:56.988 --> 00:05:01.508
What is actually being done in Hong Kong now includes a new body to help homeowners with

00:05:01.508 --> 00:05:06.008
renovation projects, after officials released the complete fire investigation.

00:05:06.508 --> 00:05:10.928
The report identified a chain of oversight failures across government and the construction

00:05:10.928 --> 00:05:16.708
sector, the South China Morning Post reports, and the government announced steps toward criminalizing

00:05:16.708 --> 00:05:17.388
bid rigging.

00:05:17.828 --> 00:05:22.928
Chief Executive John Lee Kachew stood alongside top officials when presenting the findings.

00:05:23.528 --> 00:05:28.048
Officials described bid rigging as a practice they intend to treat as a criminal offense going

00:05:28.048 --> 00:05:28.468
forward.

00:05:28.468 --> 00:05:34.628
The new oversight body will begin operations while authorities pursue the recommended regulatory changes.

00:05:35.342 --> 00:05:45.902
Elsewhere, independent petroleum dealers in Kenya say they may stop buying from oil marketing companies that exceed maximum wholesale prices set by the energy and petroleum regulatory authority.

00:05:46.522 --> 00:05:56.302
University students held a rally outside the Chicago Mercantile Exchange that prompted discussion among financial figures about a 68-year-old prohibition on onion futures trading.

00:05:56.302 --> 00:06:03.494
To really understand missile tests as signaling tools, start with the calendar, not with the idea of a sudden outburst.

00:06:04.054 --> 00:06:13.114
Most coverage treats these launches as unpredictable explosions of temper, yet they follow a recurring pattern tied to domestic politics and international leverage.

00:06:13.734 --> 00:06:23.074
The regime typically times tests to coincide with periods when it seeks attention from Washington or Seoul, or when internal consolidation requires a display of strength.

00:06:23.074 --> 00:06:28.954
Launches are often announced in advance or conducted in ways that avoid direct territorial violation,

00:06:29.554 --> 00:06:33.734
allowing Pyongyang to claim defensive intent while still demonstrating capability.

00:06:34.494 --> 00:06:39.134
Historical records show similar volleys in 2017 and 2022,

00:06:39.814 --> 00:06:42.854
preceded periods of diplomatic outreach or sanctions talks.

00:06:43.494 --> 00:06:47.314
Knowing that pattern helps you distinguish routine signaling from genuine escalation

00:06:47.674 --> 00:06:49.814
when officials describe a test as provocative.

00:06:49.814 --> 00:06:56.054
The same tests also serve as technology demonstrations to domestic audiences and to potential

00:06:56.054 --> 00:06:57.734
buyers of North Korean arms.

00:06:58.604 --> 00:07:02.474
Observers can compare the number and type of missiles fired against previous cycles

00:07:02.864 --> 00:07:08.334
to gauge whether the event represents incremental technical progress or a sharper jump in capability.

00:07:08.974 --> 00:07:13.254
Cross checking the timing against the official calendar of state events adds a layer that

00:07:13.254 --> 00:07:15.394
pure reaction coverage often omits.

00:07:15.394 --> 00:07:20.054
Cross-reference official statements from more than one government with satellite imagery

00:07:20.054 --> 00:07:24.974
or independent monitoring groups when you can, and lean on primary documents such as

00:07:24.974 --> 00:07:29.714
United Nations Reports or National Defense Ministry releases for what was actually

00:07:29.714 --> 00:07:30.294
observed.

00:07:30.754 --> 00:07:35.634
When you next see reports of a launch, check whether it's sat near a major holiday, a leadership

00:07:35.634 --> 00:07:38.474
anniversary, or a stalled negotiation round.

00:07:38.934 --> 00:07:44.034
That single detail often shows whether the action is mainly internal messaging or an attempt

00:07:44.034 --> 00:07:49.781
to reset external talks. AP news stays with the projectile flights and the friction between

00:07:49.781 --> 00:07:54.941
the two Koreas, while Al Jazeera treats the same security moment as part of a wider picture

00:07:54.941 --> 00:08:00.201
of regional stability. Officials have still to say whether Al Salvador's extra soldiers will

00:08:00.201 --> 00:08:06.181
join the existing United Nations backed mission in Haiti or operate separately. That's omnivue.

